<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <title>QR buổi tập - FitCity</title>
    <%- include('../partials/client-head') %>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/qrcode@1.5.4/build/qrcode.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="p-6 md:p-12 min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <header class="flex justify-between items-start mb-8">
        <div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black italic tracking-tighter uppercase leading-none">
                QR <span class="text-primary"><%= action === 'start' ? 'BẮT ĐẦU' : 'KẾT THÚC' %></span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-2">
                Đưa màn hình cho PT quét. Mã sẽ tự hết hạn sau ít phút.
            </p>
        </div>
        <a href="/client/workouts" aria-label="Quay lại" class="w-12 h-12 glass rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/60">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
        </a>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6">
        <% if (session.status === 'Pending_Admin') { %>
        <section class="glass rounded-[32px] p-6 w-full max-w-lg text-center">
            <div class="text-amber-500 mb-3">
                <svg class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="font-black text-slate-900 text-lg mb-2">Chờ phê duyệt</p>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Lịch tập này đang chờ Admin phê duyệt. Bạn sẽ nhận thông báo khi được duyệt.</p>
        </section>
        <% } else { %>
        <section class="glass rounded-[32px] p-6 w-full max-w-lg">
            <input id="qrTokenValue" type="hidden" value="<%- token %>"/>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shrink-0">
                        <img src="<%= session.pt && session.pt.avatar ? session.pt.avatar : 'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=PT&background=333&color=fff' %>" class="w-full h-full object-cover" alt="PT">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">PT</p>
                        <p class="text-slate-900 font-black"><%= session.pt && session.pt.name ? session.pt.name : 'PT' %></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-right">
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Giờ</p>
                    <p class="text-slate-900 font-black"><%= new Date(session.scheduledTime).toLocaleString('vi-VN') %></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-4 flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-200">
                <canvas id="qrCanvas" width="320" height="320" class="w-[320px] h-[320px] max-w-full"></canvas>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2">
                <button type="button" class="px-4 py-3 bg-primary text-white font-black uppercase rounded-2xl hover:brightness-110 active:scale-[0.99] transition-all shadow-lg shadow-accent/20"
                        onclick="copyToken()">
                    Copy mã (fallback)
                </button>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
                    Nếu PT không quét được camera, gửi mã thủ công để PT dán vào màn quét.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <% } %>
    </main>

    <script>
        const token = "<%- token %>";
        const canvas = document.getElementById('qrCanvas');
        window.QRCode.toCanvas(canvas, token, {
            errorCorrectionLevel: 'M',
            margin: 1,
            width: 320,
            color: { dark: '#0F172A', light: '#ffffff' }
        });

        async function copyToken() {
            try {
                await navigator.clipboard.writeText(token);
                alert('Đã copy mã.');
            } catch (e) {
                prompt('Copy mã bên dưới:', token);
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
